Update the stale WASMI_VERSION macros in the C API header.

`crates/c_api/include/wasmi.h` still defines WASMI_VERSION as "0.35.0"
(MAJOR 0, MINOR 35) while the crate is version 2.0.0. This sets them to
2.0.0 so C consumers and generated bindings see the right version.

Present at wasmi v2.0.0 and still on upstream main (f0c20dc5).
Upstream: not yet reported

diff --git a/crates/c_api/include/wasmi.h b/crates/c_api/include/wasmi.h
index 2caffa37..25942c7f 100644
--- a/crates/c_api/include/wasmi.h
+++ b/crates/c_api/include/wasmi.h
@@ -10,15 +10,15 @@
 /**
  * \brief Wasmi version string.
  */
-#define WASMI_VERSION "0.35.0"
+#define WASMI_VERSION "2.0.0"
 /**
  * \brief Wasmi major version number.
  */
-#define WASMI_VERSION_MAJOR 0
+#define WASMI_VERSION_MAJOR 2
 /**
  * \brief Wasmi minor version number.
  */
-#define WASMI_VERSION_MINOR 35
+#define WASMI_VERSION_MINOR 0
 /**
  * \brief Wasmi patch version number.
  */
